<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia July broad money M3 up 25.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia July broad money M3 up 25.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's broad money M3 expanded by 25.1 percent year-on-year in July against 22.9 percent growth in June, the central bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>		   MALAYSIA MONETARY AGGREGATES:</p>
<p>	 (Percentage change at end of period, year-on-year)</p>
<p>	     July 96     June 96     May 96</p>
<p>  M1	  17.3	   11.7	 13.2</p>
<p>  M2	  22.9	   21.6	 25.4</p>
<p>  M3	  25.1	   22.9	 25.5</p>
<p>Note: M1 - money in circulation and cash on deposit in banks</p>
<p>	 M2 - M1 plus time, savings and foreign currency deposits</p>
<p>	 M3 - broad money</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
